003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Stream name is one of the mandatry field for every Nimbrel Probe agent.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source_a states the stream name is a mandatory field for every agent.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The Nimbrel Probe stream name is what seperates one instrumented process from the next.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source_b states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The stream name cant contain arbitrary symbols\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source_a states the stream name cannot contain arbitrary symbols.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Only letters, digits, spaces and hyphens are accepted\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source_b states only letters, digits, spaces and hyphens are accepted.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"[here](https://docs.nimbrel.example/probe/agent/java/current/config-core.html#config-stream-name)\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source_a cites this URL as the documentation for the stream name restriction.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"as documented [here](https://docs.nimbrel.example/probe/agent/browser/current/configuration.html#stream-name)\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source_b cites this URL as the documentation for the accepted characters.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source_a states this verbatim.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"letters, digits, spaces and hyphens only, and nothing else\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source_a states 